      "| Return value | Condition | Example |",
      "| --- | --- | --- |",
      "| 1 | the last three digits are the same but non-zero | `\"253444\"` |",
      "| 2 | the last three digits are zero | `\"253000\"` |",
      "| 3 | the first three and last three digits are the same | `\"410410\"` |",
